    "note": "Chaptered session law (5006-S.SL). Large file; only the marked gun parts are quoted. Sec. 1 adds definitions (mental health professional, substance use disorder professional) and renumbers; Sec. 4 (RCW 9.41.352) changes the waiver form wording."
